{"title":"童工的遭遇","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1965,"month":6,"day":20}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 小童工，扛大锤，压碎娃娃背脊椎。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦树根，苦水浇，雪压枝头不放苞。阶级压迫童工泪，血泪养肥资本家。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吸血鬼，黑心肠，榨干我儿每滴血。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傅文淑,宋克君,黄玄之,宋克君"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦与累，紧相连，终身难忘奴隶鞭。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傅文淑　宋克君"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黄玄之　吴强年"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(组画)"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}